{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras/e5958a8322eae055eea301db421dc335.poster.avif?t=1755307769\" width=1600 height=87 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras/e5958a8322eae055eea301db421dc335.webm?t=1755307769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Awakening with lost memories, [I] found myself imprisoned in an unfamiliar room.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And before [me] appeared\u2014a peculiar girl.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>She declared you her most important person, insisting this room was your sanctuary.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a tale of a hollow amnesiac and a cage-weaving enigmatic girl\u2014fates forever entwined.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras/a42c37ddfe82fbda53c248f4ce5fe6db.avif?t=1755307769\" data-has-big width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras/2fd9f107f11b6bb90fa1c53bdf2a6255.avif?t=1755307769\" data-has-big width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras/e39e16ee0b7bfcb0e3ab30f6069889b5.poster.avif?t=1755307769\" width=1600 height=87 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras/e39e16ee0b7bfcb0e3ab30f6069889b5.webm?t=1755307769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2740 <strong>Shiro</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deceptively serene, pink-haired girl in white.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She mutters to herself, spirals into despair, then erupts into madness... Her emotions shift at terrifying speed, her psyche ever-unstable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One misstep will trigger her rage...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet sometimes, sadness surfaces\u2014for you, her most precious one, lost your memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She chains you with &quot;protection&quot; and honeyed words, sealing every exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What happened beyond these walls? What secrets does she hide?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras/d572b7819ebba6b5194728c5c35e3398.poster.avif?t=1755307769\" width=1600 height=980 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras/d572b7819ebba6b5194728c5c35e3398.webm?t=1755307769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras/d572b7819ebba6b5194728c5c35e3398.mp4?t=1755307769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras/bd340d051f17012f2487e66187a71070.poster.avif?t=1755307769\" width=890 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras/bd340d051f17012f2487e66187a71070.webm?t=1755307769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946810/extras/bd340d051f17012f2487e66187a71070.mp4?t=1755307769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn